      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Groveland%2C_New_York",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "Canaseraga Creek, a north‑flowing tributary of the Genesee River, crosses the southwest part of Groveland through a broad valley.",
